Are you ready to pick the perfect job? 🤔 This is your dream job as a warehouse worker at Wasco. 📦 As a warehouse worker at Wasco in Apeldoorn you can earn up to €20,26 per hour. So, grab this opportunity to become the best orderpicker from Wasco! 🚀

For this function you will need your own housing in the Netherlands. Unfortunately we do not offer housing with this job. ❌ Apply now and get a WhatsApp message within 15 minutes with questions so we can help you quickly. 📱 Do not have a WhatsApp? 📞 Then we will contact you by phone or email! ✉️

What we offer
- Great salary! Starting from €16,21 per hour (21+)
- Allowances up to 25%! That means €20,26 per hour!
- Working full-time or part-time during the week! 💪
- Every weekend you are free, nice! 📝
- Opportunities to develop and learn!
- A really nice and fun work environment!

Who you are
To keep the warehouse running smoothly, it is important that you meet the following requirements:

-     You speak English, for safety reasons;    
- You are at least 18 years old, due to driving an EPT;    
- You are at least available to work on Mondays and Fridays (more days are possible);    
- You are available to work in different shifts. The working hours are from 09:00 to 18:00 and  12:00 to 21:00;    
- You have your own transport to get to Apeldoorn;    
- You are physically capable of lifting product weighing at least 20 kilos;    
- You agree that we can not offer a guarantee of hours.

What will you do
Let me take you through a typical workday as a warehouse worker at Wasco in Apeldoorn! When you arrive at the warehouse, you start your day with a free cup of coffee. ☕ Then you lace up your work shoes. You step into the spacious warehouse and greet your friendly colleagues. You will be working with a voice pick system, where orders are sent straight to your headset. 🎧 You will locate the products in the warehouse. And lift them onto your EPT to transport them to their designated spots. Expect to work with heavy items like toilet bow

Job description:Would you like to work as an order picker in 's-Heerenberg? You will pick and check different products and earn €15.32 per hour. You will work 40 hours per week on a fixed day shift from Monday to Friday.
As an order picker, you will collect different products in the warehouse. You will receive instructions through a headset telling you where to go and which items you need.
- Pick products;
- Scan and check items;
- Work with a headset;
- Complete orders

You will work from Monday to Friday, from 08:00 to 17:00.
What we offer:As an order picker, you can expect:
- A salary of €15.32 per hour, which equals €2,655 per month based on 40 hours per week;
- Weekly salary payments;
- Travel allowance for your kilometres;
-  A fixed day shift from 08:00 to 17:00;
- Evenings and weekends off.

About company:You will work for a large and professional logistics company in 's-Heerenberg. You will work together with colleagues and supervisors in a fixed department within the warehouse.
Application process:Would you like to work as an order picker in 's-Heerenberg? Apply now and find out if this full time position is right for you.
Or send a WhatsApp message to Chat with Stefanie and Kim 
Requirements:- You speak and understand Dutch or English;
- You are available for 40 hours per week;
- You can work from 08:00 to 17:00;
- You have your own transport to 's-Heerenberg.

Are you an enthusiastic Order Picker with EPT experience, or are you eager to learn? We are looking for motivated candidates to join a modern logistics company in Helmond. As an Order Picker with EPT, you will be responsible for collecting, checking, and moving goods throughout the warehouse. Your work ensures that customer orders are processed accurately and shipped on time.

Your responsibilities:

- Picking customer orders using a handheld scanner;
- Checking orders before shipment;
- Moving goods and pallets using an Electric Pallet Truck (EPT);
- Wrapping, labeling, and scanning pallets;
- Performing Value Added Services (VAS) activities;
- Supporting various warehouse and logistics processes;
- Maintaining a clean, safe, and organized working environment.

Working Hours in the regular day shift: 07:00 AM – 04:00 PM. During peak periods in July till October, a two-shift schedule applies:

- 06:00 AM – 03:00 PM
- 03:00 PM – 12:00 AM

- Has experience operating an EPT or is willing to learn;
- Fulltime available;
- Is flexible regarding tasks and working hours;
- Performs well under pressure;
- Enjoys working in a team;
- Has a good command of Dutch and/or English;
- Has a proactive and hands-on attitude.
